# Files that stay in this repository and never go into the typst/packages PR
# (read by scripts/package; patterns match from the repo root, `*` also matches `/`).
#
# What does go: typst.toml, src, LICENSE, README.md, and the files the README
# links to (CHANGELOG.md, docs/manual.pdf and the thumbnails in docs/). Those
# linked files are listed under `exclude` in typst.toml so Universe shows them
# without bundling them into the archive users download.

.github
.gitignore
.claude
*.DS_Store
examples
scripts
tests
Justfile
# manual sources, the developer guide and the thumbnail source
docs/*
!docs/manual.pdf
!docs/thumbnail-*.svg
